&lt;p&gt;Dear ${visitor.full_name},&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We regret to inform you that your visit request has been rejected. Below are the details of your visit request:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="details"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visit:&lt;/strong&gt; ${number}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Date:&lt;/strong&gt; ${start_date}&lt;/p&gt;
