&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; ${location.name}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Host:&lt;/strong&gt; ${host.information}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Purpose of Visit:&lt;/strong&gt; ${purpose}&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause. If you have any questions or need clarification about this decision, please feel free to reach out to our support team or contact your host directly.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thank you for your understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
